    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>🍻本期主播</span></p><p><span>天谌：@你的充气小白兔，前媒体、金融从业者</span></p><p><span>祝明：@编剧祝明，“豆瓣低分榜”编剧</span></p><p><span>费费：编剧、正在尝试严肃写作的作者</span></p><p><span>🔖本期制作人：祝明、天谌</span></p><p><span>⏰时间轴</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="149">02:29</a> 非名家不抄</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="524">08:44</a> 蒋方舟事件观察：她这个水平居然是抄的？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="596">09:56</a> 蒋方舟：营销炒作的宗师级人物</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="959">15:59</a> 文学圈还有救吗？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1159">19:19</a> 蒋方舟获奖文章“佳句”选读</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1370">22:50</a> 初代文学商业化体验：小朋友，你有书稿要出版吗？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1545">25:45</a> 新概念作文大赛溯源：从保送到加分到没落</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2059">34:19</a> 从文学神童到编剧：作者费费试图找点苦吃</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2228">37:08</a> 恭喜蒋方舟，抄袭曝光可以是她文学梦的开端</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2573">42:53</a> “蒋方舟穷其一生都在COSPLAY一个作家”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2787">46:27</a> 业内对抄袭司空见惯了吗？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3137">52:17</a> 创作的快乐，抄袭者永远偷不走</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3535">58:55</a> 反抄袭的主要责任方应该在谁？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3761">01:02:41</a> 茅奖、诺奖作品，一定优秀吗？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4215">01:10:15</a> 从网文到视频，民间创作正在取而代之</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4732">01:18:52</a> 中国的升学公平挑战：文科的兴起与没落</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5149">01:25:49</a> 清华邱班清退风波：做好长期和老鼠屎斗争的准备</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5667">01:34:27</a> 读者负责读，作者负责写，行业负责管</span></p>]]></description>
