  <item>
    <title>从做题家到数学家：北大数院埋没王虹了吗？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a6ed9141b5e24969ce786bb</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a6ed9141b5e24969ce786bb</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 02 Aug 2026 05:50:57 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>🍻本期主播</span></p><p><span>天谌：@你的充气小白兔，前媒体、金融从业者</span></p><p><span>蔡桥：中国顶尖数学竞赛教练，北大数院06级</span></p><p><span>🔖本期制作人：祝明、天谌</span></p><p><span>⏰时间轴</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="308">05:08</a> 北大数院埋没王虹了吗？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="415">06:55</a> 数学家成长三阶段：各阶段淘汰率极高</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="673">11:13</a> 王虹所说的discouraged是什么意思？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="823">13:43</a> 早在2018年，中国人已经无限接近菲尔兹奖</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1090">18:10</a> 费城获奖现场：难得一遇的北大顶级数学家聚会</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1152">19:12</a> 菲尔兹奖的非数学因素：国力、人脉、话语权等</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1301">21:41</a> 北大数院全球第几？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1552">25:52</a> 北大数院只筛选、不培养？要看中位数和众数</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1748">29:08</a> 做题家VS数学家</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2100">35:00</a> 神奇的数院07级：史上女性比例最高一届</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2483">41:23</a> 成长型王虹与天赋怪邓煜：顶级数学家的两种代表</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2532">42:12</a> 天赋怪很难被埋没</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2696">44:56</a> 成长型选手的崛起：比天赋更重要的素质</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3219">53:39</a> 学术道路孤独艰苦，但数院校友彼此支持</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3439">57:19</a> 北大数院：“我们一直非常注重转系生”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3605">60:05</a> 数学竟然不怕开窍晚？！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3734">62:14</a> 数学实在做不来，就去华尔街发大财吧（狗头）</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3898">64:58</a> 数学家真正的困扰：别饿死，找方向</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4127">68:47</a> “他们为什么不回国？”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4447">74:07</a> 法国教育最大的问题竟然是……</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4727">78:47</a> 中国人，未来可能不会再缺席菲尔兹</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4789">79:49</a> 数学到底有什么用？</span></p><p><span>费城菲尔兹奖后北大数院校友聚会照片：</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiEwSWaVgcuSba8RWnH_Jf_xHKt2.jpg"><p><span>（全体合影）</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvnruHXqmC2ZuOR_s-IhwJV6eBNW.jpg"><p><span>（蔡桥等06级校友与王虹合影）</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/nhJaTdk4FXqgX8uCIBvEkp044j4k.jpg"><p><span>（蔡桥等06级校友与邓煜合影）</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgyEp6gjZExk-irqPSr6cLW43Wyr.jpg"><p><span>（国际数学家大会北大数院历届报告人）</span></p>]]></description>
