    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a360fc2608f69578bd6f7c6</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 20 Jun 2026 04:24:30 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>🍻本期主播</span></p><p><span>祝明：@编剧祝明，“豆瓣低分榜”编剧</span></p><p><span>Jojo：@Jokielicious，前旅英微博博主</span></p><p><span>叨叨：@蹦蹦跶跶好叨叨，译员、外事工作者</span></p><p><span>🔖本期制作人：祝明、天谌</span></p><p><span>⏰时间轴</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="41">00:41</a> 为什么韩餐、日餐、意餐都有自己的英文名，中餐却没有？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="160">02:40</a> 中翻英：端午节凭什么变成“龙舟节”？！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="264">04:24</a> 外国人玩《原神》：什么？这原来不是日本游戏？！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="501">08:21</a> 少类比，多展示</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="824">13:44</a> 日韩文化小偷的区别</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1024">17:04</a> 马斯克拆掉日本推特墙，老外为何大惊失色？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1541">25:41</a> 中国144小时过境免签政策：神来之笔！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1689">28:09</a> 从喀什古城到流坑古村：历史与现代的自然交融</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2327">38:47</a> 塔县的护边员队伍</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2679">44:39</a> 台湾同胞在新疆塔县</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2777">46:17</a> Jojo的新疆美食推荐</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2991">49:51</a> 四川乐山在海外出名竟然是因为——</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3201">53:21</a> 中国故事是座富矿</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3402">56:42</a> Jojo的英国奇遇：这就不活啦？！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3652">60:52</a> 抢救十二木卡姆</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3972">66:12</a> 中国对外旅游急需变革</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4140">69:00</a> 翻译行业的焦虑与机遇</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4576">76:16</a> 英翻中的文化赋魅与侵蚀</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5234">87:14</a> 翻译界的标准化进程</span></p>]]></description>
