  <item>
    <title>《给阿嬷的情书》：献给爱人，小人不配</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a0f0848e1eb34a939d86b81</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a0f0848e1eb34a939d86b81</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 22 May 2026 04:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>🍻本期主播</span></p><p><span>天谌：@你的充气小白兔，前媒体、金融从业者</span></p><p><span>图图：@图特哈蒙，配音演员</span></p><p><span>祝明：@编剧祝明，“豆瓣低分榜”编剧</span></p><p><span>🔖本期制作人：祝明、天谌</span></p><p><span>⏰时间轴</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="355">05:55</a> “21世纪目前最佳华语电影！”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="537">08:57</a> 推荐《阿嬷》给每一个我爱的人，我恨的人不配！</span></p><p><em><span>以下内容涉及剧透</span></em></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="783">13:03</a> 祝明的年味潮汕之旅</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1173">19:33</a> 潮汕营商风格：平等、务实、满足感</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1492">24:52</a> 展现困难≠渲染苦难≠制造苦难</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1864">31:04</a> 图图的侨批博物馆之旅：人民史观</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2509">41:49</a> 闽南潮汕地区女性的独特风貌</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2809">46:49</a> 重男轻女是刻板印象吗？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3206">53:26</a> 《阿嬷》是否回避女性剥削问题？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3408">56:48</a> 《阿嬷》与中国古典文学的共鸣</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3539">58:59</a> 《阿嬷》与是枝裕和：虚幻与真实，精致与粗粝</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4004">01:06:44</a> 电影快死了吗？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4543">01:15:43</a> 《阿嬷》观影沉浸感：我就是这段故事的旁观者</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4740">01:19:00</a> 创作细节见功力：市侩大嫂的配角塑造</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5020">01:23:40</a> 《阿嬷》观影心路：每三十分钟，推翻一次预期</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5165">01:26:05</a> 图图：“我不配给《阿嬷》配音！”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5619">01:33:39</a> 花絮趣事：从“真麻将搭子”到“村公众号宣传”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5843">01:37:23</a> 淑柔阿姨，别再被骗了！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6103">01:41:43</a> 科班演员能去上个班吗？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6406">01:46:46</a> 《阿嬷》能载入影史吗？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="7272">02:01:12</a> 蟑螂煮水真能治病？！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="7452">02:04:12</a> 嗜酒和脏话的阶级表达</span></p>]]></description>
