    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>🍻本期主播</span></p><p><span>天谌：@你的充气小白兔，前媒体、金融从业者</span></p><p><span>蔡桥：中国顶尖数学竞赛教练</span></p><p><span>🔖本期制作人：祝明、天谌</span></p><p><span>⏰时间轴</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="9">00:09</a> 顶级做题家的履历长啥样？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="540">09:00</a> “我在北大数院属于特别正常的人类”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="864">14:24</a> 顶级做题家的常见出路有哪些？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1644">27:24</a> 做题家上华尔街会被歧视吗？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1774">29:34</a> 做金融“曲线救国”可行吗？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1969">32:49</a> 金融的本质是……？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2472">41:12</a> 我们可以选择用什么方式挣钱</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2821">47:01</a> 中国真的需要发展金融行业吗？？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3067">51:07</a> 优秀学生能做出更好的职业选择吗？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3389">56:29</a> 清北还未被美国制裁的原因</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3724">62:04</a> 从“我能做什么”到“我想做什么”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3875">64:35</a> 如何评价中国特色做题筛选机制？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4066">67:46</a> “双减”做对了吗？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4177">69:37</a> 挫折教育vs快乐教育：中国人还是太爱反思了</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4433">73:53</a> 中国教育发展远落后于社会发展</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4545">75:45</a> 基础教育与高等教育的重大挑战与变革尝试</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4771">79:31</a> 做题有止境吗？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5072">84:32</a> 什么样的学生最令人欣慰？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5344">89:04</a> 孩子实在不会做题怎么办：不要躺平</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5583">93:03</a> 普通人做题上限与下限</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5815">96:55</a> 初高中衔接挑战</span></p><p><span><a