  <item>
    <title>空心村发展实录：河北马家庄的复苏实验</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6923d3f66018cc2c984953ed</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6923d3f66018cc2c984953ed</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 24 Nov 2025 03:52:46 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmOJtU6kY1Xmt_hPC1d6rgw4-u07.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>🍻本期主播</span></p><span></span><p><span>天谌：@你的充气小白兔，前媒体、金融从业者</span></p><span></span><p><span>李沅：政治学青年学者</span></p><span></span><p><span>魏主任：河北威县马家庄驻村下沉工作队队员</span></p><span></span><p><span>🔖本期制作人：祝明、天谌</span></p><span></span><p><span>⏰时间轴</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="14">00:14</a> 社会主义的大大震撼</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="357">05:57</a> 收获季雨水连天，村里的玉米还好吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="609">10:09</a> 驻村马家庄初印象：水和泥混合路</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="791">13:11</a> 乡村振兴十几年，怎么没叫上马家庄？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1035">17:15</a> 小小村的特殊困境</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1167">19:27</a> 河北创新机制：下沉工作队</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1549">25:49</a> 马家庄“确诊”为集体经济薄弱，工作队“对症下药”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1804">30:04</a> 马家庄发展第一步：土地流转与农业</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2222">37:02</a> 马家庄发展第二步：借设备开服装公司</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2631">43:51</a> 发展难点：订单在哪里？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2720">45:20</a> 一步小小的闲棋：村道的墙绘（💐河南肆墨福文创团队义务帮助创作）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2878">47:58</a> 马家庄发展第三步：村庄建设与文创餐饮</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3128">52:08</a> 引入外部投资：从多伦多返乡创业的烤肉店郭老板</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3625">60:25</a> 斜杠烤肉店：村里的小卖部/咖啡馆/小酒馆/社区食堂/快递代提点</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3823">63:43</a> 村民心态：从观望到自信</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3959">65:59</a> 集体经济“三三三”分配机制：劳务工资、基础设施建设与再生产</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4122">68:42</a> 马家庄与东部沿海农村模式比较</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4887">81:27</a> 驻村工作队vs大学生村官/“三支一扶”机制</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5183">86:23</a> 工作队驻村帮扶歌：</span></p><span></span><p><span>驻村队员要注意，待人谦逊是要义</span></p><span></span><p><span>交谈态度要和气，言语尊重讲情谊</span></p><span></span><p><span>见面招呼不失礼，主动握手莫迟疑</span></p><span></span><p><span>少说多听善解意，邻里团结事可期</span></p><span></span><p><span>一切日常要自理，饮食着装需得体</span></p><span></span><p><span>谋划多听当地计，决策须经支部议</span></p><span></span><p><span>一言一行要牢记，初心不可须臾离</span></p><span></span><p><span>🔗参考材料链接</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/VCLF1qwuyxst-avAhwNpUQ" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/VCLF1qwuyxst-avAhwNpUQ"><span>王东宾：空心村”如何变“实”？河北威县马家庄村经验探索</span></a></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqNDfz2VgON8WedWbe6hDVYHk--Y.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>（村道修建前）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqXvG9gROcEqKDApxywiBtixxeAr.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>（村道修建后）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlfC23upgGB9o3KbdaHUw523DLIE.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>（烤肉店修建前）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/llp8-hUfFWnopUMKl4Lrj9QregAh.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>（烤肉店修建后）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lghjGQznbN4Da46oE8LGySpg7Pfs.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>（邢台威马服装有限公司）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrRUZL3eKzZulQ6GwjUz9ASl3-G-.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>（夏天避暑温馨提示）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuvkSCF3_1-CeR11rf_NBw5c0WiY.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhhZ_9FknKp5wm3jmGa5GL7qqX7V.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FloQsu45peDNKQFSmHfcJlcTQZAk.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuwRBKTCc_TJlu5gsZ2P4NIYOid7.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhUVNhyOKLlA_c3kDooRVN5H0WDx.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
