    <guid isPermaLink="false">6913f81521e6d1bd34150582</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 12 Nov 2025 03:34:56 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>🍻本期主播</span></p><span></span><p><span>祝明：@编剧祝明，“豆瓣低分榜”编剧</span></p><span></span><p><span>黄斌：@黄斌，莫桑比克新晋地主</span></p><span></span><p><span>叨叨：@蹦蹦跶跶好叨叨，译员、外事工作者</span></p><span></span><p><span>🔖本期制作人：祝明、天谌</span></p><span></span><p><span>⏰时间轴</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="91">01:31</a> 莫桑比克的“最上面”和“最下面”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="291">04:51</a> 穿得起拖鞋=有产阶级</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="748">12:28</a> 叨叨的非洲朋友都来自哪些国家？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1251">20:51</a> 非洲有“中产”吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1793">29:53</a> 政经不分家：首富不当省长，谁当省长？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2211">36:51</a> 中国公务员体制才是异端</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2325">38:45</a> 莫桑的“义务教育”：有义务，但没教育</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2602">43:22</a> 莫桑的“免费医疗”：人命说没就没了……</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2969">49:29</a> 外宾的中国震撼：红灯停、绿灯行</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3228">53:48</a> 非洲的基建黑洞</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3333">55:33</a> 中外基层治理比较</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3692">61:32</a> 在非洲谈文化传承是一种奢侈</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3996">66:36</a> “感谢上帝带我来中国”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4245">70:45</a> 非洲人存在“民族劣根性”吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4569">76:09</a> 中国人在海外老被针对吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5004">83:24</a> 外国海关为什么喜欢敲诈中国人？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5182">86:22</a>K签迷思：为什么印度人要来我家拉屎？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5370">89:30</a> 非洲人的优点：从不内耗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5528">92:08</a> 中国人自己都远远低估了中国</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5585">93:05</a> 去非洲治疗“精神内耗”</span></p>]]></description>
